{{!
    @template tool_vae/renewals_page

    The page of the certifications whose date has passed, below its heading: what a positioning is, what the list says,
    the day of the reading, then one sentence when no date has passed, or the table.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\renewals_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text is escaped (double braces), except one key of HTML (triple braces): tablehtml, the table drawn by the template
    tool_vae/table.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disclaimer - string, what a positioning is and is not
    * intro - string, what the list says
    * asof - string, the day of the reading
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when no date has passed
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disclaimer": "A positioning says where the structure stands on a competency or a bloc. It is not a validation.",
        "intro": "For each certification below, the date given by the management has passed.",
        "asof": "On the day of reading: 2026-11-19",
        "none": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable tool-vae-renewals\"><tbody><tr><td>Camille Durand</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    }
}}
<p class="text-muted small">{{disclaimer}}</p>
<p>{{intro}}</p>
<p class="text-muted small">{{asof}}</p>
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
